[en.pihc_state_temperature_tt]
§Y[THIS.GetName]§! current state:
Outdoor temperature: [THIS.GetPIHCStateOutdoorTemperatureColored]
Indoor temperature: [THIS.GetPIHCStateIndoorTemperatureColored]
Indoor temperature class: [THIS.GetPIHCStateTemperatureClassName]
Comfort score: §Y[?THIS.PIHC_var_state_indoor_temperature_comfort_score|1] / 10.0§! (§Y[?THIS.PIHC_var_state_temperature_population_share_percent|1] %§!)
-----
National temperature comfort: §Y[?THIS.PIHC_var_state_controller_temperature_comfort_score|1] / 10.0§!

State effects:
Supply factor: [?THIS.PIHC_var_state_supply_factor|1+%]
Local manpower: [?THIS.PIHC_var_state_local_manpower|1+%]
State construction speed: [?THIS.PIHC_var_state_production_speed_buildings_factor|1+%]
[THIS.GetPIHCStateTemperatureNationalModifierEffects]
-----
§LEach state's §Youtdoor temperature§L (§Ymercury thermometer§L reading) is determined by §Yenvironment§L, §Ydisharmony§L, and similar factors.
§YIndoor temperature§L (§Yspherical gauge§L value) starts from outdoor temperature, then changes with §Yheating policies§L, §Yenergy towers§L, and related effects.
Only §Yindoor temperature§L determines the §Ytemperature class§L (§Ygauge pointer§L) and its §Ycomfort score§L.
The country receives population, construction speed, and other modifiers from the §Ypopulation-weighted national average comfort score§L.
Keep the regions containing most of your §Ycore population§L in the comfortable range (§Y-10 ~ 30§L) whenever possible.§!

[zh.pihc_state_temperature_tt]
§Y[THIS.GetName]§! 地块当前：
室外温度为：[THIS.GetPIHCStateOutdoorTemperatureColored]
室内温度为：[THIS.GetPIHCStateIndoorTemperatureColored]
室内温度等级：[THIS.GetPIHCStateTemperatureClassName]
舒适度分数：§Y[?THIS.PIHC_var_state_indoor_temperature_comfort_score|1] / 10.0§!（§Y[?THIS.PIHC_var_state_temperature_population_share_percent|1] %§!）
-----
全国温度舒适度：§Y[?THIS.PIHC_var_state_controller_temperature_comfort_score|1] / 10.0§!

地区修正：
补给效率：[?THIS.PIHC_var_state_supply_factor|1+%]
当地人力：[?THIS.PIHC_var_state_local_manpower|1+%]
地区建造速度：[?THIS.PIHC_var_state_production_speed_buildings_factor|1+%]
[THIS.GetPIHCStateTemperatureNationalModifierEffects]
-----
§L每个地块的§Y室外温度§L（§Y水银温度计读数§L）由§Y环境§L、§Y不和谐度§L等因素决定。
§Y室内温度§L（§Y球形仪表温度数值§L）以室外温度为基础，并受到§Y供暖政策§L、§Y能量塔§L等因素影响。
最终仅根据§Y室内温度§L计算§Y温度档位§L（§Y仪表指针§L），进而获得对应的§Y舒适度等级分§L。
全国的人口、建造速度等修正来自按§Y马口§L加权的§Y全国平均舒适度等级分§L。
因此，请尽可能保障国家主要§Y马口§L所在地区的温度处于舒适范围（§Y-10 ~ 30§L之间）。§!

